\n\
Maybe I should let them attack and block with Yargle, trading. Then I'd have no creatures again. Not good.\n\
\n\
I could cast Grotesque Mutation on Yargle after they declare attackers? I need mana. I have no untapped lands. Can't.\n\
\n\
