      "reasoning": "Opponent attacks with only Spiteful Prankster. They are not attacking with flyers (maybe they are summoning sick). Chandra's Spitfire is sick, Dragon Hatchling is not sick (tapped? Actually it's untapped). They could attack with Dragon Hatchling but maybe they want to keep it as a blocker.\n\
