\n\
Dragon Hatchling is 0/1 flyer.\n\
\n\
I have a 3/3 that can't block flyers but can attack ground.\n\
\n\
I think exiling Spitfire is good to prevent future growth and flying damage. I'll sacrifice Skullslither Worm.\n\
\n\
Cast Eaten Alive targeting Chandra's Spitfire.\n\
\n\
Choose p39.\n\
