But wait, I have land drop remaining. I could play a land but I have none.\n\
\n\
I'll pass and hope to draw a creature next turn.\n\
\n\
But I should also consider that opponent's Dragon Hatchling power resets to 0 at end of turn? It's until end of turn, so now it's back to 0/1. Good.\n\
\n\
Opponent's Rapacious Dragon is still summoning sick (entered last turn). Next turn it can attack.\n\
\n\
I'm at 9 life, opponent at 7.\n\
\n\
I need to stabilize. I'll pass.\n\
\n\
Choose no.\n\
