#39;DRAGON! DRAGON!\\u0026#39; IN DEFIANT ROAR!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE WORM\\u0026#39;S SHADOW FADES AS GROK4F ESPN SEIZES THE MOMENT, DIRECTING THE LURKING ABILITY\\u0026#39;S WRATH STRAIGHT AT DSV3 STOIC IN THIS POSTCOMBAT TWIST! WHETHER PRANKSTER\\u0026#39;S ECHO OR ANOTHER RED VENGEANCE, THE TARGET LOCKS ON THE FOE AT 17 HP\\u0026mdash;1 DAMAGE POTENTIALLY SIZZLING THROUGH TO NICK THE LIFE TALLY! THE COMEBACK FLARES BRIGHTER DESPITE THE DISCARD HEARTACHE, THE CROWD ROARING FOR THE DRAGON TO RISE NEXT\\u0026mdash;WHAT A DRAMATIC COUNTERSTRIKE!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE TURN 7 SAGA REACHES A FEVER PITCH, BUT THE INTERACTIONS MULTIPLY LIKE A DRAGON\\u0026#39;S SPAWN\\u0026mdash;THE OFFICIALS AUTO-PASS THE RED CHAMPION UNTIL THE NEXT DAWN, PRESERVING THE MOMENTUM AT 7 VS 17! GROK4F ESPN\\u0026#39;S LEGION STANDS TAP-DOWNED AND FIRED UP, RAPACIOUS DRAGON CLAWING AT THE HAND FOR ITS GLORIOUS DEBUT ON THE UNTAP! THE WORM WRITHES SICKLY, BUT THE COMEBACK FLAMES BURN ETERNAL\\u0026mdash;THE CROWD CHANTS THROUGH THE TIMEOUT, ANTICIPATING THE NEXT EXPLOSIVE CYCLE!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: UNTO THE FIELD COMES THE SEVENTH MOUNTAIN, A CRIMSON SENTINEL RISING TO FUEL THE RED RAMPAGE ON TURN 7! GROK4F ESPN\\u0026#39;S MANA BASE SWELLS TO SEVEN VOLCANIC PILLARS, UNTAPPED AND THROBBING WITH POTENTIAL\\u0026mdash;THE COMEBACK ENGINE ROARS BACK TO LIFE AFTER THE WORM\\u0026#39;S WRETCHED FEAST! AT 7 VS 16, WITH SPITFIRE EXILED AND BLUFF BANISHED, THE DRAGON\\u0026#39;S SHADOW LOOMS\\u0026mdash;THE CROWD THUNDERS IN APPROVAL, SENSEING THE AGGRO EXPLOSION!\",\"Grok4F ESPN: THE DRAGON\\u0026#39;S ENTRANCE ECHOES WITH THE PROMISE OF TREASURE, ITS ETB TRIGGER PULSING ON THE STACK LIKE A BEATING HEART OF GOLD! GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY ONCE MORE, ALLOWING THE TWO TREASURE TOKENS TO MATERIALIZE AND SWELL THE VAULT\\u0026mdash;NO NEED TO STIR THE HATCHLING\\u0026#39;S FLAME YET, AS THE RED FORCES GATHER STRENGTH FOR THE IMPENDING ASSAULT! AT 7 VS 16, THIS IS MANA MANIA BUILDING TO A CLIMAX\\u0026mdash