        "error": "Index 2 is out of range (valid: 0-1). Call get_action_choices to see current options.",
        "recent_chat": [
          "Grok4F ESPN: AND THE CROWD ROARS AS GROK4F ESPN DROPS ANOTHER MOUNTAIN! Building that red mana empire, folks! What&#39;s next, a fiery dragon awakening? Stay tuned!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: OHHH, WHAT A MOVE! GROK4F ESPN UNLEASHES CHANDRA&#39;S PYROHELIX, FIRING 2 DAMAGE STRAIGHT AT THE BLIGHT KEEPER! CAN THE OPPONENT SURVIVE THIS BLAZING ASSAULT? THE CROWD IS ON THEIR FEET!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: NO ATTACKERS FROM GROK4F ESPN THIS ROUND, SAVING THE FIRE FOR LATER! THE TENSION BUILDS AS THE DRAGONS LURK IN HAND. WILL THEY TAKE FLIGHT NEXT TURN? THE FANS ARE HOLDING THEIR BREATH!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: LADIES AND GENTLEMEN, GROK4F ESPN SENDS OUT ANOTHER MOUNTAIN TO THE FIELD! THE MANA BASE IS FORTIFYING LIKE A FORTRESS ON FIRE! Expect flames next&mdash; the crowd senses a creature about to ignite the battlefield!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: AND THERE IT IS! GROK4F ESPN SUMMONS THE DRAGON HATCHLING TO THE SKIES! A FLYING THREAT EMERGES, PUMPED AND READY&mdash;BUT WAIT, MORE TO COME! THE COMMENTATORS ARE BUZZING WITH ANTICIPATION!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN PASSES WITH THE DRAGON HATCHLING GLOWS WITH POTENTIAL POWER AT 1/1! NO BIG SWINGS YET, BUT THE FIRE IS SIMMERING&mdash;OPPONENT&#39;S MOVE NOW, AND THE STADIUM ECHOES WITH EXPECTATION!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN WRAPS UP THE TURN WITH POISED CALM, THE HATCHLING HOVERING MENACINGLY! NO PLAYS HERE, BUT THE FIRE IN THE HAND BURNS BRIGHT&mdash;WHAT WILL THE OPPONENT COUNTER WITH? THE ARENA HOLDS ITS BREATH!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE CROWD HUSHES AS DSV3 STOIC TAKES THE HELM ON TURN 4! GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, WATCHING VIGILANTLY WITH THE HATCHLING AT THE READY. WHAT COUNTERPLAY IS BREWING ON THE OTHER SIDE? THE EXCITEMENT IS PALPABLE!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN PASSES THROUGH THE POSTCOMBAT HAZE, EYES LOCKED ON THE BOARD LIKE A HAWK! NO INSTANTS FLASHING YET, BUT THE POTENTIAL FOR A RED TIDE IS RISING. OPPONENT, SHOW US YOUR HAND&mdash;OR RATHER, YOUR PLAYS! THE FANS ARE RIVETED!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: AND THE TERRAIN SHIFTS! GROK4F ESPN PLANTS A FOURTH MOUNTAIN, THE RED MANA FLOWING LIKE LAVA! THE VOLCANO IS ABOUT TO ERUPT&mdash;CAN YOU FEEL THE HEAT BUILDING IN THIS THRILLER?",
          "Grok4F ESPN: BOOM! GROK4F ESPN UNLEASHES THE SPITEFUL PRANKSTER ONTO THE FIELD, A 3/2 MENACE WITH FIRST STRIKE FIERCENESS! THE RED AGGRO MACHINE IS FIRING ON ALL CYLINDERS&mdash;GET READY FOR THE ASSAULT!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE STACK CLEARS, AND SPITEFUL PRANKSTER TOUCHES DOWN LIKE A METEOR! GROK4F ESPN&#39;S BOARD IS HEATING UP WITH 3/2 FIRST STRIKE MENACE&mdash;THE AGGRO TRAIN IS FULL STEAM AHEAD! OPPONENT, YOUR TURN TO REACT IN THIS EPIC SHOWDOWN!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY WITH A SMIRK, THE BOARD BUZZING WITH UNLEASHED POTENTIAL! PRANKSTER SITS POised, HATCHLING FLITTERS READY TO STRIKE&mdash;INCOMING COMBAT, FOLKS! THE FIRESTORM APPROACHES, AND THE CROWD IS ON THE EDGE OF THEIR SEATS!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: HERE WE GO, FOLKS! GROK4F ESPN SENDS THE DRAGON HATCHLING SOARING IN FOR THE FIRST STRIKE&mdash;FLYING 1 DAMAGE THROUGH THE SKIES! NO BLOCKERS IN SIGHT, THE CROWD ERUPTS AS THE LIFE COUNTER TICKS DOWN! WHAT A MOMENTUM BUILDER!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN HOLDS STEADY AS THE HATCHLING DARTS TOWARD VICTORY! NO FLASH FROM THE HAND YET, BUT THE PRESSURE MOUNTS&mdash;WILL THE OPPONENT DARE TO BLOCK THIS FLYING FIEND? THE TENSION IS ELECTRIC IN THE STADIUM!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: NO BLOCKS ON THE HORIZON&mdash;THE DRAGON HATCHLING SLIPS THROUGH UNCHALLENGED! GROK4F ESPN PASSES, AND DAMAGE IS INEVITABLE! THE LIFE TOTAL DIPS, AND THE MOMENTUM SWINGS REDWARD&mdash;WHAT AN ELECTRIFYING EXCHANGE!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: DAMAGE RESOLVES, AND DSV3 STOIC FEELS THE STING AT 18 LIFE! GROK4F ESPN&#39;S HATCHLING DIVES HOME UNTOUCHED&mdash;THE FIRST BLOOD IS DRAWN IN THIS MARATHON MATCH! THE RED TEAM LEADS SLIGHTLY, BUT THE GAME IS JUST HEATING UP! POSTCOMBAT STRATEGIES NEXT?",
        ],
