      "action_result": {
        "game_seq": 269,
        "error": "Object p51 not found in current choices",
        "recent_chat": [
          "Grok4F ESPN: GROK4F ESPN SURVEYS THE POSTCOMBAT FIELD WITH GRIM SATISFACTION&mdash;HATCHLING&#39;S STRIKE LANDS TRUE, OPPONENT AT 18! NO FURTHER MOVES HERE, PASSING TO END OF TURN. THE RED FLAMES FLICKER BRIGHTER; WHAT WILL THE COUNTERSTRIKE BE? THE AUDIENCE ROARS FOR MORE!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: OH NO, FOLKS! DSV3 STOIC DROPS THE HAMMER WITH YARGLE, GLUTTON OF URGORG ON THE STACK&mdash;A MASSIVE BEAST LURKING! GROK4F ESPN PASSES, UNABLE TO COUNTER THIS MONSTER YET, BUT THE RED FIRE IS BANKED FOR THE COMEBACK! THE STADIUM GASPS AT THIS POWER PLAY!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: YARGLE CRASHES ONTO THE SCENE LIKE A TITAN FROM THE DEPTHS, 9/3 BEHEMOTH STARING DOWN THE RED FORCES! GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, BRACING FOR THE IMPACT&mdash;BUT THE FIRE INSIDE BURNS HOTTER THAN EVER! WILL THIS GLUTTON DEVOUR THE MOMENTUM, OR SPARK THE COMEBACK OF THE CENTURY? THE CROWD IS STUNNED!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE COMBAT HORN BLARES, BUT YARGLE THE GLUTTON STANDS STILL, SUMMONING SICKNESS BINDING HIS RAGE! GROK4F ESPN PASSES WITH A KNOWING GRIN&mdash;NO THREAT THIS TURN, BUT THE BEHEMOTH LOOMS LARGE! THE RED FORCES RELOAD FOR THE COUNTEROFFENSIVE; THE ARENA BUZZES WITH SUSPENSE!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: POSTCOMBAT CALM DESCENDS AS GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, THE RED LEGION UNTAPPED AND READY FOR TURN 5! YARGLE LOOMS LIKE A SHADOW OVER THE FIELD, BUT THE FLAMES OF AGGRO BURN BRIGHTER&mdash;THE NEXT TURN PROMISES FIREWORKS! THE CROWD CHANTS FOR THE COMEBACK!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: AND THE CARDS FLY! GROK4F ESPN CASTS THRILL OF POSSIBILITY, DISCARDING THE WEAK LINK TO DRAW FRESH AMMO FROM THE LIBRARY! THE RED ENGINE HUMS, SETTING UP THE NEXT BIG SWING&mdash;CAN THE OPPONENT SURVIVE THE INCOMING DRAGONFIRE? THE CROWD ROARS IN ANTICIPATION!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THRILL OF POSSIBILITY HOVERS ON THE STACK, PROMISING FRESH CARDS TO FUEL THE RED RAMPAGE! GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, THE DISCARD OF COALBORN ENTITY A CALCULATED SACRIFICE FOR GREATER POWER! THE DRAW IS IMMINENT&mdash;WHAT SECRETS WILL THE LIBRARY REVEAL IN THIS HIGH-STAKES DRAW? THE FANS LEAN FORWARD!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE LANDSCAPE EVOLVES! GROK4F ESPN DROPS A FIFTH MOUNTAIN, UNLEASHING A FRESH GUSH OF RED MANA FROM THE DEPTHS! WITH YARGLE LURKING, THE RED FORCES FORTIFY&mdash;THIS IS THE SETUP FOR A SPECTACULAR SUMMONING! THE STADIUM SHAKES WITH EXCITEMENT!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: IGNITION! GROK4F ESPN SUMMONS CHANDRA&#39;S SPITFIRE, THE FLYING ELEMENTAL BLAZING INTO EXISTENCE WITH 1/3 WINGS OF FIRE! WHENEVER THE OPPONENT TASTES NONCOMBAT HEAT, IT SWELLS TO 4/3 RAMPAGE&mdash;THE BOARD BUILDS, AND COMBAT LOOMS LARGE! THE CROWD ERUPTS AS THE RED AIR FORCE ASSEMBLES!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE STACK WHIRS AS CHANDRA&#39;S SPITFIRE TOUCHES DOWN, ITS FLAMES LICKING THE AIR&mdash;1/3 FLYING FORCE READY TO SWELL WITH EVERY BURN! GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, THE ELEMENTAL INTEGRATING SEAMLESSLY INTO THE RED ARMADA! YARGLE WATCHES, BUT THE SKIES BELONG TO THE DRAGONS NOW&mdash;THE COUNTDOWN TO COMBAT BEGINS, AND THE ARENA TREMBLES!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: THE WINDS SHIFT AS GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, THE BOARD SET WITH SPITFIRE&#39;S FLAMES AND PRANKSTER&#39;S MENACE! COMBAT CALLS, AND WITH YARGLE BOUND BY SICKNESS, THE RED FORCES ADVANCE UNCHECKED&mdash;GET READY FOR THE AERIAL ASSAULT, THE CROWD&#39;S ROAR DEAFENING THE STADIUM!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: CHARGE! GROK4F ESPN UNLEASHES THE SPITEFUL PRANKSTER, DASHING IN WITH FIRST STRIKE MENACE FOR 3 UNSTOPPABLE DAMAGE! THE HATCHLING HOLDS THE LINE, BANKING POWER FOR THE NEXT VOLLEY, WHILE SPITFIRE RECUPERATES&mdash;THE RED AGGRO ROLLS ON, AND YARGLE CAN ONLY WATCH! THE CROWD EXPLODES AS THE LIFE COUNTER DROPS!",
          "Grok4F ESPN: PRANKSTER CHARGES AHEAD WITH MENACE AND FIRST STRIKE, FORCING THE OPPONENT&#39;S HAND&mdash;BLOCK OR BLEED? GROK4F ESPN PASSES PRIORITY, THE ATTACK UNCHALLENGED FOR NOW! YARGLE SITS IDLE, BUT THE RED MENACE DEMANDS A RESPONSE&mdash; WILL THE DEFENSE CRUMBLE? THE TENSION SKYROCKETS!",
        ],
